# The backend is NOT ignored on this branch.
#
# `main` carries a rule that ignores `/duka_pos_backend/` because on `main` the
# directory is a stale checkout leftover rather than source. Merging `main` into
# a backend branch brought that rule along, and it silently hid every *new*
# backend file: tracked files kept showing as modified, so the breakage looked
# like a clean working tree until something tried to commit.
#
# On this branch the backend IS the source. Its build output is excluded by
# duka_pos_backend/.gitignore (node_modules, dist, .env, logs), which is the
# right layer for it.

# Local agent tooling and vendored third-party skills — machine-local only,
# never part of the project source. Provenance lives in
# .kilo/skills/ATTRIBUTION.md on disk.
/.kilo/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# Signing material — defence in depth. duka_pos_app/android/.gitignore already
# covers these; the rules are repeated at the repo root so a keystore generated
# anywhere else in the tree (a scratch copy, a keytool run from the home
# directory) is still refused by git. Losing this material is unrecoverable for
# app updates: a new key means every shop device must reinstall and re-pair.
*.jks
*.keystore
key.properties